This directory contains miscellaneous tools.

testbed -- This is a guile shell statically linked with the curses
	library.  It is for debugging purposes.

gucushell -- This starts an interactive guile session that opens an
	xterm that will be controlled by ncurses.

pre-inst-gucushell -- A tiny script that allow running gucushell 
	before the gucu library is installed

keypress.scm -- This script helps one investigate how the keys in a
	terminal map to curses key codes

	